<title>UK: Brixton Estate to buy industrial freehold.</title>
<headline>Brixton Estate to buy industrial freehold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Brixton Estate Plc said on Tuesday it agreed to buy an industrial park freehold in Basingstoke, southern England, from Standard Life Assurance Co for 43 million stg cash, excluding costs.</p>
</text>
